1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,653
A warning from the market.

2
00:00:01,653 --> 00:00:06,796
The calcium carbide used to ripen mangoes does not release ethylene.

3
00:00:06,796 --> 00:00:13,684
It releases acetylene, along with toxic impurities, so the fruit looks ripe but tastes of nothing.

4
00:00:13,684 --> 00:00:16,744
Carbide ripening is prohibited in Nepal.

